  "plain": "Two Navy pilots who saw the same strange object off Southern California in 2004 do not agree on how long the encounter lasted. According to the UFO skeptic Mick West, the pilot Alex Dietrich says her part of it lasted only 8 to 10 seconds, from the moment they closed in on the object to the moment it flew away, a much shorter span than the version told by her fellow pilot David Fravor. West raises this on Michels's show to question how reliable the witness accounts are."
